OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA damp end
OL,6,Fto Friday for some, mainly in western
OL,7,Fregions. Often dry in the east
OL,8,Fovernight but a chance of further rain
OL,9,Fat times elsewhere, locally heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent over the hills. Windy and
OL,11,Fmuch milder than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAn increasingly dry day for
OL,14,Fmost with sunny spells, but rain may
OL,15,Faffect the far south at times. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarm in the sunshine with the brisk
OL,17,Fwesterly winds gradually easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
