OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLighter
OL,6,Fwinds on Sunday with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Somewhat cloudier early next
OL,8,Fweek with perhaps some rain in the far
OL,9,Fnorthwest at times. Dry elsewhere with
OL,10,Fwarm sunny spells.
